    "The generator uses the correct column convention and both elementary routes on every oriented edge. Both source and oracle retain exact state kinetics and use every rate control.",
    "The physical observable is reversible chemical reservoir-regeneration work, not reaction enthalpy or a simple thermal calorimeter. The signed elementary-route currents multiply their specified chemical-potential drops. Stationarity cancels internal energy and state entropy terms.",
